  "ruleText": "Env-A 101.169-Env-A 101.220 Env-A 105.01-Env-A 105.52\n\nDocument #13105 replaces all prior filings for the rules in Chapter Env-A 100. As organizational rules the rules in Document #13105 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II",
